ions and  in Luxembourg we have the chance as a  small country with a dynamic economy to  be little bit yeah like a lighthouse and  and really show that our possibility  other possibilities exist so that we can  find other solutions the way we move  around shapes our cities our lives our  work and our environment Luxembourg's a  very small country but this could be a  very big idea  Adam Parsons Sky News Luxembourg
 

